    text: "On this island live **knights**, who always tell the truth, **knaves**, who always lie, and **normals**, who do either as they please. Among the three you meet there is exactly one of each.\n\nYou meet Olga the oyster diver, Finn the fisherman and Ada the ferry-keeper at the masked ball.\n\n**Olga**: “If Finn is normal, then Ada is normal.”<br>**Finn**: “Ada and I are of the same kind.”<br>**Ada**: “I am normal.”",
