    text: "Every native of this island is a **knight**, who always tells the truth, or a **knave**, who always lies.\n\nYou meet Kofi the canoe builder, Iris the innkeeper, Yara the yam grower, Flora the florist and Suki the surfer at the weather station.\n\n**Kofi**: “Flora is a knight.”<br>**Iris**: “Exactly four of us are knights.”<br>**Iris**: “Either Suki is a knight or Flora is a knave, but not both.”<br>**Flora**: “Either Iris is a knave or Suki is a knight.”<br>**Suki**: “At least two of us are knights.”<br>Yara says nothing.",
